- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use only into mostly physical EXP lanes when crowd control is light enough to skip Fortitude.; Dominance Ice over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when attack-speed carries, sustain fighters, or shield-heavy frontliners must hit Martis first.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use when a burst mage can kill Martis during the vulnerable window after Mortal Coil ends.; Antique Cuirass over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against repeated physical skill burst from fighters or assassins that can chase through the second S2 cast.
